<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
		<title>Checkout - Phone Phony</title>
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
		<script src="https://use.fontawesome.com/releases/v6.3.0/js/all.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Montserrat:400,700" rel="stylesheet"/>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto+Slab:400,100,300,700" rel="stylesheet"/>
		<link href="/assets/css/homeStyles.css" rel="stylesheet"/>

	</head>
	<body
		id="page-top">


		<!-- Navbar -->
		<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg bg-dark navbar-dark fixed-top " id="mainNav">
			<div class="container">
				<a class="navbar-brand" href="/home">Phone Phony</a>
			</div>
		</nav>


		<!-- Checkout Container -->
		<div class="container mt-5 py-5 bg-white text-dark rounded-3 ">
			<div
				class="row g-5 mt-3 mt-5">
				<!-- Carrito de Compras -->
				<div class="col-md-5 col-lg-4 order-md-last">
					<div class="card shadow-sm border-2">
						<div class="card-body">
							<h4 class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
								<span class="text-primary fw-bold">Tu carrito</span>
								<span class="badge bg-primary rounded-pill" id="cart-count">0</span>
							</h4>

							<ul class="list-group mb-3" id="cart-items">
								<li class="list-group-item text-center text-muted">Cargando productos...</li>
							</ul>

							<div class="d-flex justify-content-between border-top pt-3">
								<span class="fw-semibold">Total (EUR)</span>
								<strong id="total-price" class="fs-5 text-dark">€0.00</strong>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>


				<!-- Formulario de Pago -->
				<div class="col-md-7 col-lg-8">
					<h4 class="mb-3">Dirección de Facturación</h4>
					<form id="checkout-form" class="needs-validation" novalidate method="POST" action="/handle-client">
						<div class="row g-3">
							<div class="col-sm-6">
								<label for="firstName" class="form-label">Nombre</label>
								<input type="text" class="form-control" id="firstName" name="firstName" required>
								<div class="invalid-feedback">Ingrese su nombre.</div>
							</div>

							<div class="col-sm-6">
								<label for="lastName" class="form-label">Apellido</label>
								<input type="text" class="form-control" id="lastName" name="lastName" required>
								<div class="invalid-feedback">Ingrese su apellido.</div>
							</div>

							<div class="col-12">
								<label for="phone" class="form-label">Número de Teléfono</label>
								<div class="input-group has-validation">
									<span class="input-group-text">
										<i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
									</span>
									<input type="tel" class="form-control" id="phone" name="phone" required pattern="^\+?[0-9\s\-]{7,15}$">
									<div class="invalid-feedback">Ingrese un número válido.</div>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="col-12">
								<label for="email" class="form-label">Correo Electrónico</label>
								<input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" name="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
								<div class="invalid-feedback">Ingrese un correo válido.</div>
							</div>

							<div class="col-12">
								<label for="address" class="form-label">Dirección Completa</label>
								<input type="text" class="form-control" id="address" name="address" required>
								<div class="invalid-feedback">Ingrese su dirección.</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<hr class="my-4">

						<button class="w-100 btn btn-primary btn-lg" type="submit">Comprar</button>
					</form>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Modal de Confirmación -->
		<div class="modal fade" id="confirmationModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="confirmationModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
			<div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
				<div class="modal-content">
					<div class="modal-header">
						<h5 class="modal-title text-success">
							<i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
							Compra Confirmada</h5>
						<button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
					</div>
					<div class="modal-body">
						<p>✅ ¡Gracias por tu compra en
							<strong>Phone Phony</strong>!</p>
						<p>📦 Tu pedido ha sido registrado con éxito y será procesado en breve.</p>
						<p>
							<strong>💳 Método de pago:</strong>
							Contra reembolso (COD)</p>
						<p>
							<strong>🚚 Entrega estimada:</strong>
							3-5 días hábiles</p>
						<p>
							<strong>📍 Dirección de entrega:</strong>
							La proporcionada en el formulario</p>
						<p class="text-muted">Te enviaremos un correo con los detalles de tu pedido. Si tienes preguntas, contáctanos en
							<strong>soporte@phonephony.com</strong>.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Bootstrap JS -->
		<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>

		<!-- Script para Cargar el Carrito -->
		<script src="/assets/js/checkout.js"></script>
	</body>
</html>
